  42:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/ComplexMathFunctions/arm_cmplx_mult_real_q15.c ****  * @brief  Q15 complex-by-real multiplication
  43:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/ComplexMathFunctions/arm_cmplx_mult_real_q15.c ****  * @param[in]  *pSrcCmplx points to the complex input vector
  44:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/ComplexMathFunctions/arm_cmplx_mult_real_q15.c ****  * @param[in]  *pSrcReal points to the real input vector
  45:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/ComplexMathFunctions/arm_cmplx_mult_real_q15.c ****  * @param[out]  *pCmplxDst points to the complex output vector
