  51:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/ComplexMathFunctions/arm_cmplx_mult_real_q15.c ****  * The function uses saturating arithmetic.
  52:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/ComplexMathFunctions/arm_cmplx_mult_real_q15.c ****  * Results outside of the allowable Q15 range [0x8000 0x7FFF] will be saturated.
  53:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/ComplexMathFunctions/arm_cmplx_mult_real_q15.c ****  */
